  "prefLabel": "We 206.17 Removal of Representatives",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 206.17 Removal of Representatives. The board shall, upon a finding of misconduct by any representative appearing before the board, prohibit that individual from acting as a representative before the board. For purposes of this section, misconduct means behavior that is disruptive to the orderly conduct of the board’s business.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
